  "changes": [
    "Remove original platform HTML, base.xml, h5api loader and platform-index.js from publication.",
    "Remove original MyAd and MoreGamePanel implementations; retain game-facing ad entrypoints through independent adapter.",
    "Specialize engine platform branches for browser web/local at build time and replace platform/server boundaries.",
    "Load original same-origin .dat packs, namespace local storage and report actual LoginPage readiness.",
    "Remove three exact-context references to upstream404 optional images; preserve hit geometry, text hints and popup controls. Render the three MessageBoxPanel text nodes with the original dLabel system-font renderer because the shipped bitmap font lacks glyphs in 金币不足 and 确定."
